kevin: Please add an explicit note about pagination cursor TTL — on staging the cursor expires after ~24h; it's a common confusion.

nate: @maria quick FYI — a couple of TOC anchor links 404ed in the preview (anchor names changed during the reorg). If you update the anchors in the PR I'll re-run the link checker.

maria: Thanks all — will: (1) apply Sam's Go changes, (2) tweak TS to show resume pattern with error handling, (3) add cursor TTL note and anchor fixes, (4) run smoke tests with Lisa, then merge after CI passes. Expecting to merge this afternoon. :thumbsup:

